OL,3,GNEWSAUber driver jailed after running
OL,4,Aover passenger
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Uber driver who ran over a passenger
OL,7,Fafter the man vomited in his car has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for five years.
OL,10,FHayadulla Turkmani, 53, was convicted
OL,11,Fof causing death by dangerous driving
OL,12,Ffollowing a trial at Basildon Crown
OL,13,FCourt.
OL,15,FThe jury heard how he picked up plumber
OL,16,FMichael Ashton, 28, and his partner
OL,17,Ffollowing a night out on 26 September
OL,18,Flast year, before taking them home to
OL,19,FLangdon Hills, Essex, where the men
OL,20,Fargued before Ashton was run over and
OL,21,Fdragged under the vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
