OL,3,GNEWSAUber driver jailed after running
OL,4,Aover passenger
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Samantha Cohen told Turkmani, who
OL,7,Fwas cleared of murder and manslaughter,
OL,8,Fthat he "failed to pay adequate regard"
OL,9,Fto where Ashton was, adding: "You
OL,10,Fshould have seen him, and you should
OL,11,Fhave stopped before you hit him."
